			<item>
				<title>最短路径</title>
				<link>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/algorithms/shortestpath/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 10 Nov 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>https://spite-triangle.github.io/cpp_notes/posts/algorithms/shortestpath/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;问题&#34;&gt;问题&lt;a href=&#34;#%e9%97%ae%e9%a2%98&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;定义&#34;&gt;定义&lt;a href=&#34;#%e5%ae%9a%e4%b9%89&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Link to this section&#34;&gt;&lt;svg class=&#34;h-4 w-4&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; xmlns=&#34;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34;&gt;&lt;g fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71&#34;/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;有向图 $G(V,E)$，每条边都存在一个权值 $W:E \rightarrow R$。图中从 $v_1 \rightarrow v_k$ 的路径 $p = {v| v_1 \rightarrow v_k}$ 其权值为&#xA;$$w(p) = \sum_{i=1}^{k-1} w(v_i, v_{i+1})$$&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
